        "Duplicate count by phone and by company name",
        "Spelling variants of the same company, with and without entity suffixes",
        "Records with no owner, or an owner who has left",
        "A cut-off date, which is the single biggest cost lever you hold",
        "Anything in free-text notes the business cannot afford to lose",
        "Encoding check: open the export and confirm Arabic text survived",
